  "description": "This place, where everything was high, including buildings in the city center, monthly rent in their own rooms, heel of high heels, height of insoles, and walls of employment, is Seoul, the city of giants. In it, the main oil is just floundering. It's none other than meeting her again, who missed her after looking at her for many days because she couldn't even talk properly to her loved ones.?! [And... Summer] A slightly dangerous romance drawn by Kim Young-jo's elegant work!\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/mad_teacher), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/mad_teache/), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000053559), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=8721566), [Comico](https://www.comico.kr/comic/8480), [Onestory](https://onestory.co.kr/detail/H042913383), [Nate](https://toonnbook.nate.com/detail/H042913383)",
